# =============================================================================
# VELO frontend image -- build-context excludes (FE-116)
# =============================================================================
# The frontend build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT since the pnpm workspace
# moved there (the lockfile and pnpm-workspace.yaml live at the root and the
# Dockerfile installs from them). The context used to be ./frontend alone;
# everything the Dockerfile never COPYs is excluded here so the widened
# context does not drag the backend tree and the working docs through every
# frontend image build -- the same reasoning that keeps backend's context
# narrow (see docker-compose.yml, the comms-profile mount).
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
packages/*/dist
.git
# FE-131: a skin package the machine checks out into the build context
# (frontend/public/skin/) may carry its own .git -- never into the image.
**/.git
.github
backend
storage
loadtest
comms-profile
scripts
docs
diagrams
Design_prototype
*.md
docker-compose.yml
